==Trivia==
The special illustration rare card features {{p|Garchomp}} and {{p|Arceus}}.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Garchomp}}.
*'''Linear Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Groudon|9}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*{{m|Dragon Claw}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Garchomp}} can learn.

